Early in a game it is important to become poison resistant, but most 
posion-resistance conveying monsters are poisonous as well. The monster 
spoilers do not say which monsters are poisonous, only which are poison 
resistant and which can convey poison resistance. So without much 
further ado, I have compiled a list here from a little source diving. 
The corpses of the following monsters may convey poison resistance 
without being poisonous:

quivering blob
chickatrice (*)
cockatrice (*)
pyrolisk
quasit
tengu
blue jelly
cave spider
centipede
white unicorn
gray unicorn
black unicorn
brown mold
red mold
shrieker
violet fungus (*)
red naga hatchling
black naga hatchling
golden naga hatchling
guardian naga hatchling
red naga
black naga
golden naga
(not guardian naga)
gray ooze
brown pudding
black pudding
flesh golem
nurse (*)
Wizard of Yendor
Master Kaen

(*) Be warned that eating these corpses may have unpleasant side effects

I suggest this information be incorporated in mon1-343.txt, perhaps by 
marking all monsters that are poisonous to eat in a separate column, or 
by marking unpoisonous, poison resistance-conveying monsters with a 
tempting "%" in the RESISTS column.

